                {
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string",
                  },
                  "type": "array",
                },
              ],
              "description": "Comma-separated or repeated values from the closed set: Active, Coming Soon, Pending. Default when omitted or empty: Active, Coming Soon. 'Pending' means "Under Contract" to consumers. It covers both the Active Under Contract and Pending MLS statuses. Sold is not a value here. No sold listing publishes in search yet.",
            },
