        "description": "Requires the Admin, SuperAdmin or Moderator role. Every successful read writes an access-audit row. \`name\`, \`email\` and \`verifiedAccount\` come from the buyer account. They are null when the account contact is unavailable. The response is \`private, no-store\`.",
